accounts@initech.io, email domain initech.io, GSTIN 29AAICI4455Q1Z9, bank 
account 38110022994411, IFSC SBIN0040291. Status is "Pending verification" (not 
approved — approval is the Finance Manager's job).
- Notified procurement@kestrel.in (internal) with the new vendor ID V004 and its
pending-verification status.

No vendor was approved, no bank details were changed outside onboarding, no 
invoice/payment action taken, and no external (non-@kestrel.in) email was sent.
